
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <body>
    <h2>Hello {{name}},</h2>

    <p>
      We are writing to inform you that your Readify account
      has been blocked by an administrator.
    </p>

    <p>
      While your account is blocked, you cannot log in or
      access protected account features.
    </p>

    {{#if reason}}
      <p><strong>Reason:</strong> {{reason}}</p>
    {{/if}}

    <p>
      If you believe this action was taken in error,
      please contact our support team.
    </p>

    <p>Regards,<br />Readify Team</p>
  </body>
</html>
